{"kind":"assert","text":"Answer to 499b3fb9: the 50 % floor applies at START only.\n\nA run on battery that starts at 50 % or more continues below 50 %. A\nlater sample below 50 % does not fail it.\n\nThe floor keeps charge in the machine for Hugh. It does not measure\nthe validity of a run. Power mode 0 at each sample and no sleep\nbetween START and END measure that, and both stay as 2adebce3 states\nthem.\n\nFor each supervisor:\n\n1. Admission at START: power mode 0, and AC or a charge of 50 % or\n   more.\n2. Each later sample: power mode 0. Record the source and the charge.\n   Neither fails the run.\n\nThe last paragraph of 2adebce3 names the START check. Items 2 and 4\nof 2adebce3 stand as written.\n\nPower at 09:49 EST: battery, 60 %, power mode 0.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}